<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr" data-theme="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#09090b">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/logo.png">
    <title>ImgFast - <%= success ? 'Silindi' : 'Hata' %></title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Display', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: #09090b;
            color: #f4f4f9;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            min-height: 100dvh;
            padding: 20px;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .card {
            background: #121216;
            border: 1px solid #27272d;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 420px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        .icon {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }
        .success .icon {
            background: rgba(34,197,94,0.1);
            color: #22c55e;
        }
        .error .icon {
            background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1);
            color: #ef4444;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        p {
            color: #a1a1aa;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        a {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: #6366f1;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }
        a:active {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="<%= success ? 'success' : 'error' %>">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">
            <%= success ? '✓' : '✕' %>
        </div>
        <h2><%= message %></h2>
        <% if (success) { %>
            <p>Dosya Cloudflare R2 sunucularından kalıcı olarak kaldırıldı.</p>
        <% } else { %>
            <p>Bir şeyler ters gitti. Lütfen tekrar deneyin veya ana sayfaya dönün.</p>
        <% } %>
        <a href="/">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/>
                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/>
            </svg>
            Ana Sayfaya Dön
        </a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
